---
interface GenerationRange { nombre: string; corto: string; desde: number; hasta: number }
interface Props { data:any; generations: GenerationRange[] }
const { data, generations } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="generations-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Fechas</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Generaciones</div><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Mapa generacional</span><h1>¿De qué generación soy según mi año de nacimiento?</h1><p>Descubrí si sos Baby Boomer, Generación X, Millennial, Z, Alpha o Beta, qué edad tenés en 2026 y qué acontecimientos atravesó tu generación.</p><div class="chips"><span>📚 Rangos Pew</span><span>🔭 Alpha y Beta</span><span>✓ Sin estereotipos</span></div><div class="gen-art"><div class="id-card"><div class="id-head"><b>Año de nacimiento</b><span>1990</span></div><small>TU GENERACIÓN</small><strong>Millennial</strong><p>Generación Y · nacidos entre 1981 y 1996</p></div><div class="avatars"><i class="person"></i><i class="person"></i><i class="person"></i></div><span class="year-tag">36 años en 2026</span></div></div>
    <form class="calc" id="gen-calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Encontrá tu generación</h2><p>La generación depende solamente del año.</p></div><span class="tag">Rangos de referencia</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Qué querés mirar?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="mine"><i>🪪</i>Mi generación</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="compare"><i>👥</i>Comparar años</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="age"><i>🎂</i>Edad en 2026</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="future"><i>🔭</i>Generaciones futuras</button></div><div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label>Año en que naciste</label><input id="birth-year" type="number" min="1928" max="2039" value="1990"></div><div class="field wide compare-field"><label>Año de la otra persona</label><input id="compare-year" type="number" min="1928" max="2039" value="2000"></div><div class="field"><label>Sexo · para esperanza de vida</label><select id="sex"><option value="female">Femenino</option><option value="male">Masculino</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>País donde vivís</label><select id="country"><option value="AR">Argentina</option><option value="CL">Chile</option><option value="CO">Colombia</option><option value="ES">España</option><option value="MX">México</option><option value="UY">Uruguay</option><option value="JP">Japón</option><option value="WORLD">Promedio mundial</option></select></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ Los rangos pueden variar según la fuente</span><b>Ver metodología</b></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Tu generación</small><div class="generation" id="result-generation">Millennial</div></div><div class="years"><small>Rango</small><strong id="result-range">1981–1996</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Edad en 2026<b id="result-age">36 años</b></span><span>Posición en el tramo<b id="result-position">Año 10 de 16</b></span><span>Vida esperada recorrida<b id="result-life">45%</b></span></div><button class="go" type="button">Actualizar generación</button></section></form>
  </div></section>
  <section class="lookup wrap" aria-labelledby="generation-table-title"><header class="center"><span>Generaciones por edad y año</span><h2 id="generation-table-title">Tabla de generaciones por año de nacimiento</h2><p>Buscá tu año en el rango. La edad es la que se cumple durante 2026; si todavía no pasó tu cumpleaños, hoy tenés un año menos.</p></header><div class="lookup-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Generación</th><th>Años de nacimiento</th><th>Edad en 2026</th></tr></thead><tbody>{generations.map((g)=><tr><th scope="row">{g.nombre}</th><td>{g.desde}–{g.hasta}</td><td>{Math.max(0,2026-g.hasta)}–{2026-g.desde} años</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="line-section wrap"><header class="center"><span>La línea completa</span><h2>Siete generaciones en una sola mirada</h2><p>Los límites son convenciones de investigación. Sirven para ordenar contextos históricos, no para describir personalidades.</p></header><div class="generation-line"><article class="band"><h3>Silenciosa</h3><b>1928–1945</b><p>Infancia entre crisis y guerra.</p></article><article class="band"><h3>Baby Boomer</h3><b>1946–1964</b><p>Expansión de posguerra.</p></article><article class="band"><h3>Generación X</h3><b>1965–1980</b><p>TV, cambios sociales y PC.</p></article><article class="band active"><h3>Millennial</h3><b>1981–1996</b><p>Internet llegó durante su crecimiento.</p></article><article class="band"><h3>Generación Z</h3><b>1997–2012</b><p>Primera infancia plenamente digital.</p></article><article class="band"><h3>Generación Alpha</h3><b>2013–2024</b><p>Pantallas, IA y aprendizaje híbrido.</p></article><article class="band"><h3>Generación Beta</h3><b>2025–2039</b><p>La generación que recién empieza.</p></article></div><div class="marker"></div></section>
  <section class="context"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>El mundo mientras crecías</span><h2>Hitos que atravesaron los Millennials</h2><p>No todos vivieron lo mismo, pero llegaron a estos cambios en edades parecidas.</p></header><div class="context-grid"><article class="card"><h3>Tu edad cuando cambió la tecnología</h3><div class="milestone"><b>1995</b><span>Internet comercial se expande</span><small>5 años</small></div><div class="milestone"><b>2001</b><span>Wikipedia sale online</span><small>11 años</small></div><div class="milestone"><b>2007</b><span>Primer iPhone</span><small>17 años</small></div><div class="milestone"><b>2010</b><span>Instagram aparece</span><small>20 años</small></div><div class="milestone"><b>2022</b><span>IA generativa masiva</span><small>32 años</small></div></article><article class="card"><h3>Tu tiempo demográfico</h3><div class="life-ring"></div><div class="life-copy"><b>36 de 80 años de esperanza estadística</b><p>Promedio para una mujer en Argentina. No es un pronóstico individual.</p></div><div class="life-note">La generación depende del año. País y sexo solo modifican esta referencia demográfica.</div></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="compare-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="compare-head"><div><span>Casos frontera</span><h2>Los años que suelen generar dudas</h2></div><div class="legend">Los cortes pueden moverse uno o dos años según la fuente</div></div><div class="compare-grid"><article class="compare-card"><i>↔️</i><h3>1964 / 1965</h3><p>El paso de Baby Boomer a Generación X.</p><b>Boomer → X</b></article><article class="compare-card"><i>↔️</i><h3>1980 / 1981</h3><p>El corte más usado entre X y Millennials.</p><b>X → Millennial</b></article><article class="compare-card"><i>↔️</i><h3>1996 / 1997</h3><p>La frontera entre Millennials y Generación Z.</p><b>Millennial → Z</b></article><article class="compare-card"><i>↔️</i><h3>2012 / 2013</h3><p>El comienzo de la Generación Alpha.</p><b>Z → Alpha</b></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="future"><div class="wrap future-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#aa94ef">Las próximas generaciones</span><h2>Alpha crece. Beta acaba de empezar.</h2><p>Los nombres futuros son marcos de investigación tempranos. Su sentido se vuelve más claro cuando esas personas comparten experiencias históricas reales.</p></div><div class="future-cards"><article class="future-card"><i>🤖</i><h3>Generación Alpha</h3><b>2013–2024</b><p>En 2026 tienen entre 2 y 13 años.</p></article><article class="future-card"><i>🌱</i><h3>Generación Beta</h3><b>2025–2039</b><p>En 2026 recién están naciendo.</p></article></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
</div>
<script is:inline>
const generations=[["Silenciosa",1928,1945],["Baby Boomer",1946,1964],["Generación X",1965,1980],["Millennial",1981,1996],["Generación Z",1997,2012],["Generación Alpha",2013,2024],["Generación Beta",2025,2039]],life={AR:78,CL:81,CO:77,ES:84,MX:75,UY:79,JP:85,WORLD:73};let activeCase="mine";const calc=document.querySelector("#gen-calc"),yearInput=document.querySelector("#birth-year"),compareInput=document.querySelector("#compare-year");
    function findGen(year){return generations.find(g=>year>=g[1]&&year<=g[2])||["Fuera del rango",year,year]}
    function update(){const year=Number(yearInput.value),other=Number(compareInput.value),g=findGen(year),age=Math.max(0,2026-year),expectancy=life[document.querySelector("#country").value]+(document.querySelector("#sex").value==="female"?2:-2),progress=Math.min(100,Math.round(age/expectancy*100)),position=`Año ${year-g[1]+1} de ${g[2]-g[1]+1}`;let title=g[0],label="Tu generación",range=`${g[1]}–${g[2]}`;if(activeCase==="compare"){const g2=findGen(other);label="Comparación generacional";title=g[0]===g2[0]?`Ambos son ${g[0]}`:`${g[0]} vs. ${g2[0]}`;range=`${Math.abs(other-year)} años de diferencia`}else if(activeCase==="age"){label="Tu edad durante 2026";title=`${age} años`;range=g[0]}else if(activeCase==="future"){label="Generación del año elegido";title=g[0];range=year>2026?"Todavía no nació":`${g[1]}–${g[2]}`}document.querySelector("#result-label").textContent=label;document.querySelector("#result-generation").textContent=title;document.querySelector("#result-range").textContent=range;document.querySelector("#result-age").textContent=`${age} años`;document.querySelector("#result-position").textContent=position;document.querySelector("#result-life").textContent=`${progress}%`}
    document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");activeCase=b.dataset.case;calc.classList.toggle("compare-mode",activeCase==="compare");if(activeCase==="future"&&Number(yearInput.value)<2025)yearInput.value=2025;update()}));document.querySelectorAll("#birth-year,#compare-year,#sex,#country").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("change",update));document.querySelector(".go").addEventListener("click",e=>{update();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Generación actualizada";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar generación",1200)});
</script>
<style>
.generations-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#111f39;background:#fff;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#111f39;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button:focus{outline:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e6ed;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#1a2d48;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#1a2d48;color:#fff;border-color:#1a2d48}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f7f9fc 0%,#f7f9fc 58%,#f5f0ff 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#7454cf}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7454cf;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#7454cf}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#101e38}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187;max-width:500px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe3ed;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#53677e;font-size:10px}
    .gen-art{height:240px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.id-card{position:absolute;left:52px;top:20px;width:248px;height:178px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe1ea;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385816;padding:21px 23px;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.id-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.id-head b{font-size:11px}.id-head span{font-size:8px;color:#7454cf;background:#f0ebff;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px}.id-card small{display:block;color:#76879a;font-size:8px;margin-top:19px}.id-card strong{display:block;font-size:29px;margin-top:3px;color:#5c40b1}.id-card p{font-size:9px;color:#6f8195;margin:12px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e8ee;padding-top:10px}.avatars{position:absolute;right:19px;bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:end}.person{width:45px;height:70px;border-radius:23px 23px 10px 10px;border:5px solid #fff;background:#ef8b74;position:relative;margin-left:-10px;box-shadow:0 8px 18px #542e2520}.person:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd8b5;left:4px;top:-20px;border:4px solid #fff}.person:nth-child(2){height:85px;background:#6b56cd}.person:nth-child(3){height:61px;background:#43b6c4}.year-tag{position:absolute;left:3px;bottom:14px;background:#eaf8fa;color:#167784;border:1px solid #cbe8eb;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
    .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe1ea;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#6b7d91;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#7454cf;background:#f0ebff;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce3eb;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#5d7188;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:65px;cursor:pointer}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #7454cf;background:#f5f2ff;color:#6144bb}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dce3eb;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.compare-field{display:none;background:#f7f4ff;border-color:#d5c9f5}.calc.compare-mode .compare-field{display:block}.field label{display:block;color:#77879a;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#65788d;font-size:9px}.advanced b{color:#7454cf}.result{background:#1a304e;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#b9cbdd}.generation{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.years{background:#eaf8fa;color:#177581;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.years strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #3e5572;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#afc0d1}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7454cf,#42b4c2);color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px;cursor:pointer}
    .lookup{padding:72px 0 8px}.lookup-table{border:1px solid #dce3eb;border-radius:16px;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #1738580b}.lookup table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff}.lookup th,.lookup td{padding:15px 18px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;font-size:13px}.lookup thead th{background:#1a304e;color:#fff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}.lookup tbody th{color:#5c40b1}.lookup tbody tr:last-child>*{border-bottom:0}.lookup tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#f8f7fc}.line-section{padding:74px 0 67px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7454cf;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#687a8f;line-height:1.6}.generation-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #17385812}.band{padding:22px 10px;min-height:150px;color:#fff;position:relative}.band:nth-child(1){background:#51657c}.band:nth-child(2){background:#357e99}.band:nth-child(3){background:#3ca38e}.band:nth-child(4){background:#6751bd}.band:nth-child(5){background:#d26f75}.band:nth-child(6){background:#e5a546}.band:nth-child(7){background:#77a544}.band h3{font-size:11px;margin:0 0 7px}.band b{font-size:9px}.band p{font-size:8px;line-height:1.45;color:#ffffffcc}.band.active:after{content:"TU AÑO";position:absolute;left:9px;bottom:10px;background:#fff;color:#5b40b0;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:7px;font-weight:900}.marker{height:34px;position:relative;margin:14px 0 0}.marker:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:44%;top:0;width:2px;height:27px;background:#182943}.marker:after{content:"1990";position:absolute;left:calc(44% - 19px);top:25px;background:#182943;color:#fff;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:8px;font-weight:800}
    .context{background:#f4f6fa;padding:69px 0}.context-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce3eb;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.milestone{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr 68px;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:13px 0}.milestone b{font-size:10px;color:#7454cf}.milestone span{font-size:10px}.milestone small{text-align:right;font-size:8px;color:#73869a}.life-ring{width:156px;height:156px;border-radius:50%;margin:2px auto 16px;background:conic-gradient(#7454cf 0 45%,#e8ebf0 45% 100%);position:relative}.life-ring:after{content:"45%";position:absolute;inset:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#5e44b5}.life-copy{text-align:center}.life-copy b{font-size:12px}.life-copy p{font-size:9px;color:#75879b;line-height:1.5}.life-note{background:#fff2df;border:1px solid #efd9b3;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font-size:8px;color:#765b2d;line-height:1.5;margin-top:12px}
    .compare-section{padding:69px 0}.compare-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:27px}.compare-head h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 0}.compare-head>div>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7454cf;font-weight:850}.legend{font-size:9px;color:#64778d}.compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.compare-card{border:1px solid #dce3eb;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;min-height:180px}.compare-card i{font-style:normal;font-size:22px}.compare-card h3{font-size:13px;margin:11px 0 6px}.compare-card p{font-size:9px;color:#77899c;line-height:1.55}.compare-card b{display:block;color:#7454cf;font-size:11px;margin-top:15px}.future{background:#1a304e;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.future-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.future h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0 13px}.future p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#bdccda}.future-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.future-card{background:#fff;color:#1a304e;border-radius:15px;padding:20px}.future-card i{font-style:normal;font-size:24px}.future-card h3{font-size:13px;margin:11px 0 5px}.future-card b{font-size:20px;color:#7454cf}.future-card p{color:#74869a;font-size:8px}.foot{height:110px}
    @media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.context-grid,.future-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.gen-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.generation-line{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.marker{display:none}.compare-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.compare-head{display:block}.legend{margin-top:10px}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.id-card{left:22px}.avatars{right:1px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.generation-line,.compare-grid,.future-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#397dd0;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#78899c;margin-top:4px}
